 "what": "A server-side correlation id for every completed RECOG-C1 observation, recovered from Cloud Logging AFTER the run.",
 "what_is_not_claimed": "This does not enumerate all 52! permutations. Checks (2) and (3) rule out other windows AT the derived offset and all near reorderings; they do not exhaustively exclude some distant permutation paired with a different offset. Given strictly sequential, non-overlapping calls on one device that is strong evidence -- but it is evidence, and the difference is stated here rather than rounded up to a proof.",
